{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PHANTOM is a Slow Paced Single Player Ghost Hunting game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(Screenshots were captured with Lumen on. You can enable it in the Graphics settings)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20 Different Ghost Types, </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With a EMF Reader,\u00a0Parabolic Mic, and UV Light as your main Evidence Items.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462440/extras/e2b345214612cddce62556b4030230e0.avif?t=1769482879\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462440/extras_big/e2b345214612cddce62556b4030230e0.avif?t=1769482879 width=1560 height=444 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY LOOP:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You explore, and investigate Haunted, and typically Abandoned locations</strong>.<br><br><strong>1] Identify the ghost</strong>'s Main Evidence to complete the <br>Main Investigation, via EMF, UV, And Parabolic evidence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then you can stick around to complete the<br>Side Investigation, via the ghost's Age, Cause of Death, Favorite Item, and Wall Writing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2] Upgrade your Equipment</strong>, from longer EMF Range, Faster Player Speed, <br>To Faster Thermometer readings, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Or Buy New Equipment</strong>. A Smartwatch to monitor your Stress, to a UV Tripod to light up a room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Or Buy a New Map, </strong>Like the School, Diner, or Cave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level up, and repeat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462440/extras/756b51ee7e32269d75e4f042911ab36c.avif?t=1769482879\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462440/extras_big/756b51ee7e32269d75e4f042911ab36c.avif?t=1769482879 width=1560 height=444 /></span><strong>STARTING EQUIPMENT: </strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EMF Reader - See the ghost throw an item, turn on a TV, or move some furniture?<br>Chances are, it left some evidence there.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thermometer - When a ghost is Haunting a room, the temperature may Raise, Lower,<br>or in some cases even stay the same. May be useful for identifying where the ghost is.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Camera - Useful for finding Side Evidence like Wall Writing.<br>Useful for identifying the Ghost Type's Side Evidence as well.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parabolic Microphone - Allows you to hear many of the ghost's interactions from further away, <br>as well as their Main Evidence, Like Screams or Whispers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spirit Box - Useful for completing the Side Investigation,<br>as well as identifying the room of a Inactive Ghost.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UV Light - Used to spot Fingerprints, Footprints, or Claw Marks from the ghost.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flashlight - Lights up dark areas.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also purchase, or find New items to replace some of the equipment above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462440/extras/5d7571485902879d086b264c0f7ddd0f.avif?t=1769482879\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462440/extras_big/5d7571485902879d086b264c0f7ddd0f.webp?t=1769482879 width=1560 height=441 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LOCATIONS:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The locations in this game are inspired by Real, and Unusual places.<br>From more Typical locations like a House or a School,<br>to more unique ones like a Pirate Ship, or a Cave.<br><br>There are currently 6 locations available, The House, School, Cave, Diner, Arcade and Ghost Ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462440/extras/89ed31058a20b2a625543ac39ba66a4d.avif?t=1769482879\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462440/extras_big/89ed31058a20b2a625543ac39ba66a4d.avif?t=1769482879 width=1560 height=444 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OTHER THINGS TO KNOW:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm a solo developer, and this is the first PC game I ever worked on.<br> Development started nearly 3 years ago!<strong> </strong>   <br> <br>This game is, and always will be: Single Player Only! <br> <br>this is a slower-paced, Investigation game, and not really suited or balanced for multiplayer.  <br>This game also uses some Lightly satirical content, like location names, and location backstories.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2462440?t=1769482879","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462440/80ab55fdddb0e2a3730e8ca8a82fcb75222620e0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769482879","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462440/8f6276a63bbd40b2732614e42eb36bccca72ebcb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769482879","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462440/8f6276a63bbd40b2732614e42eb36bccca72ebcb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769482879","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Captions available","id":13}